
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Relíquias do Gil</title>

<style>
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #10131b;
  color: #f5f1e8;
  min-height: 100vh;
}

header {
  padding: 25px 8%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 15px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #34313a;
}

.logo {
  width: 55px;
  height: 55px;
  border: 2px solid #d6ad55;
  border-radius: 14px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  color: #e7bd65;
  font-size: 22px;
  font-weight: bold;
}

.brand {
  font-size: 19px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
}

.brand span {
  display: block;
  color: #d6ad55;
  font-size: 11px;
  margin-top: 5px;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
}

main {
  min-height: 75vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 40px 20px;
}

.emblem {
  font-size: 65px;
  color: #d6ad55;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

h1 {
  font-size: clamp(32px, 7vw, 58px);
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

h1 span {
  color: #d6ad55;
}

.subtitle {
  color: #c0bdc3;
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  max-width: 550px;
  margin-bottom: 35px;
}

.button {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 15px 35px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: #d6ad55;
  color: #17130b;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: bold;
  transition: 0.3s;
}

.button:hover {
  background: #f0cc7a;
  transform: translateY(-3px);
}

footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 25px;
  color: #85818a;
  font-size: 12px;
  border-top: 1px solid #34313a;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">RG</div>
  <div class="brand">
    RELÍQUIAS DO GIL
    <span>UM MUNDO DE DESCOBERTAS</span>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <div class="emblem">✦</div>

  <h1>RELÍQUIAS <span>DO GIL</span></h1>

  <p class="subtitle">
    Seja bem-vindo!
    <br>
    Um espaço para encontrar coisas interessantes,
    descobertas especiais, ferramentas, downloads
    e oportunidades que merecem ser compartilhadas.
  </p>

  <a href="#explorar" class="button">ENTRAR E EXPLORAR</a>
</main>

<footer>
  © 2026 Relíquias do Gil · Todos os direitos reservados
</footer>

</body>
</html>
